  console.log('Received data:', data);
});

socket.on('disconnect', () => {
  console.log('Disconnected from the server');
});
```

Socket.IO gives you a high level of abstraction, so you can focus on your game client's logic while it handles the underlying WebSocket communication. If you need to work with raw WebSockets instead, modern browsers' built-in WebSocket API is there too, though it means more manual connection and message handling, wan~ 🐾

